      "name": "Primary Route Action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "primary-action",
      "description": "打开路线、复制链接或返回安全入口的主要操作。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary-action\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"/><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"/></svg>复制完整链接</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary-action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:48px;padding:10px 16px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:#1747D1;color:#fff;font:800 14px system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-primary-action svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2}.ds-primary-action:hover{background:#1038AC}.ds-primary-action:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-primary-action:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #F2D229;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
